{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-1",
      "transcript": "How can light reveal an obstacle without being absorbed or reflected by it?",
      "file": "audio/ifm/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.3,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.1",
      "samples": 127200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Start with one photon and two possible paths that meet again.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.666666666666667,
      "duration": 4.275,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.2",
      "samples": 102600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-3",
      "transcript": "In this carefully aligned setup, the waves associated with the paths cancel at one output. This detector stays dark.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 10.166666666666666,
      "duration": 8.2,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.3",
      "samples": 196800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Now block one path with an absorber.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 18.566666666666666,
      "duration": 2.75,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.4",
      "samples": 66000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Sometimes it absorbs the photon. That trial ends.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 21.533333333333335,
      "duration": 3.925,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.5",
      "samples": 94200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-6",
      "transcript": "But in another trial, the dark detector clicks.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 25.666666666666668,
      "duration": 3.275,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.6",
      "samples": 78600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The photon reached this detector. The obstacle was detected, without absorbing that photon.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 29.333333333333332,
      "duration": 6.525,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.7",
      "samples": 156600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Why? Blocking one possible path removed the cancellation that kept this detector dark.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 36.06666666666667,
      "duration": 6.05,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.8",
      "samples": 145200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-9",
      "transcript": "This is interaction-free measurement, demonstrated in experiments.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 42.333333333333336,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.9",
      "samples": 110400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-10",
      "transcript": "It succeeds only in some trials. Others absorb the photon, or give no clear answer.",
      "file": "audio/ifm-v3/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 47.3,
      "duration": 6.275,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "interaction-free.asset.dark-detector.script.10",
      "samples": 150600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
